WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.112
Section 6.

00:00:02.062 --> 00:00:06.787
The Public Sector Integrity Commissioner — the watchdog that doesn't bite.

00:00:06.787 --> 00:00:12.512
In 17 years, PSIC has found wrongdoing in fewer than 10 cases.

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:15.575
Hundreds of disclosures have been dismissed.

00:00:15.575 --> 00:00:23.862
The Commissioner lacks subpoena power, cannot protect witnesses, and reports to the same government whose misconduct is being reported.
